was a woman. A priest, a \"goddess\" and a ruler. She was buried with her 
mirror in her hand. Do not be mislead by the weapons in her grave - even in 
much later times, for example Etruscan women in Italy were buried with them: 
especially spears, knives etc. And she was a Minoan woman - much different than
Mycenaeans in appearance. Minoans were there before Nestor palace was built. 
