and documents Evans's 1925 publication, but another source dates the find to 
1915. No supplied source documents the transfer, purchase, possession, or other
ownership event connecting the find to Evans; the provenance gap is therefore 
explicit but unresolved."}, {"criterion": "Conflicting accounts of the find and
chain of custody are explicitly compared and attributed, including distinctions
from the Thisbe/Dombrena treasure and the Griffin Warrior grave rings.", 
"status": "unmet", "supporting_refs": [], "reason": "The evidence compares the 
1915 Evans account with the later 1924 account and distinguishes uncertainties 
within the Thisbê/Dombrena tomb group. It does not supply evidence about the 
Griffin Warrior grave rings, nor does it establish a complete chain-of-custody 
